{"id":"n47381-1-8","stage":4,"title":"더디다 · 慢","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n47381-1-8-1","ko":"오늘따라 버스가 도착이 더디네요.","zh":"今天公交车来得真慢啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘따라","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；따라：强调某个时间、场合等与平常不同，如 오늘따라（偏偏今天）。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘따라","audio":"/audio/63be5b9d45dede0ea5d0.mp3"}},{"text":"버스가","meaning":"公共汽车，公交车","explanation":"버스：公共汽车，公交车；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"버스","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36678","senseId":"1","lemma":"버스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버스가","audio":"/audio/4a5fae1e77392a579e0a.mp3"}},{"text":"도착이","meaning":"到达","explanation":"도착：到达；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"도착","audio":"/audio/103f83573455f3b61eed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64543","senseId":"1","lemma":"도착","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도착이","audio":"/audio/b53063dbf9f61441a185.mp3"}},{"text":"더디네요.","meaning":"慢，迟缓","explanation":"더디다：慢，迟缓；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"더디다","audio":"/audio/ac71c0ac6abd1c8d6c06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47381","senseId":"1","lemma":"더디다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더디네요","audio":"/audio/c255bb326cdcb4b5157e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"fb84fa7f86eac62e","term":"버스","zh":"公共汽车，公交车","audio":"/audio/fb84fa7f86eac62eca5f.mp3","entryId":"36678","definition":"收取费用、按照规定路线行驶、可乘坐多人的大汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"103f83573455f3b6","term":"도착","zh":"到达","audio":"/audio/103f83573455f3b61eed.mp3","entryId":"64543","definition":"抵达目的地。","pronunciation":["도ː착"]},{"id":"ac71c0ac6abd1c8d","term":"더디다","zh":"慢，迟缓","audio":"/audio/ac71c0ac6abd1c8d6c06.mp3","entryId":"47381","definition":"速度缓慢，做某事时需要较长时间。","pronunciation":["더디다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f86a6e1959cacd0993e2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n47381-1-8-2","ko":"이러다 늦겠어요. 그냥 택시를 타죠.","zh":"这样下去要迟到了，我们直接打车吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이러다","meaning":"这么着","explanation":"이러다：这么着；다：连接途中转换或接续的动作，具体要结合前后文。","readings":[{"term":"이러다","audio":"/audio/a42eace37d0e6c1863cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24838","senseId":"1","lemma":"이러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이러다","audio":"/audio/a42eace37d0e6c1863cb.mp3"}},{"text":"늦겠어요.","meaning":"晚，迟到","explanation":"늦다：晚，迟到；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"늦다","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61181","senseId":"1","lemma":"늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늦겠어요","audio":"/audio/5278f9fa3ce19b1e3848.mp3"}},{"text":"그냥","meaning":"就那样","explanation":"그냥：就那样。","readings":[{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36241","senseId":"1","lemma":"그냥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그냥","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3"}},{"text":"택시를","meaning":"出租车","explanation":"택시：出租车；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"택시","audio":"/audio/94be61a73763ee4ccdbe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18772","senseId":"1","lemma":"택시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"택시를","audio":"/audio/2fbdb0907659160b0c98.mp3"}},{"text":"타죠.","meaning":"乘，乘坐","explanation":"타다：乘，乘坐；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"타다","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17160","senseId":"1","lemma":"타다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"타죠","audio":"/audio/8836e9a226fc50df5c9d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a42eace37d0e6c18","term":"이러다","zh":"这么着","audio":"/audio/a42eace37d0e6c1863cb.mp3","entryId":"24838","definition":"这样做。","pronunciation":["이러다"]},{"id":"8678e3dcf30b4fad","term":"늦다","zh":"晚，迟到","audio":"/audio/8678e3dcf30b4fad0aa5.mp3","entryId":"61181","definition":"过了已定的时间。","pronunciation":["늗따"]},{"id":"e32fb95151ec34cc","term":"그냥","zh":"就那样","audio":"/audio/e32fb95151ec34ccb0d2.mp3","entryId":"36241","definition":"什么都不做而原封不动地。","pronunciation":["그냥"]},{"id":"94be61a73763ee4c","term":"택시","zh":"出租车","audio":"/audio/94be61a73763ee4ccdbe.mp3","entryId":"18772","definition":"收费后，将客人送到其指定地点的汽车。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8f835109fdc29a59","term":"타다","zh":"乘，乘坐","audio":"/audio/8f835109fdc29a59b6ab.mp3","entryId":"17160","definition":"坐到交通工具或当作交通工具的动物背上。","pronunciation":["타다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e368003f6b56d83da71f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.273,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=47381","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":123,"sequenceScore":2.0997,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["今天公交车来得真慢啊。","这样下去要迟到了，我们直接打车吧。","一个多星期没看见敏俊了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["今天公交车来得真慢啊。","这样下去要迟到了，我们直接打车吧。","一个多星期没看见敏俊了。"],"answer":1}]}
